WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.868 line:0%
-Face it.
-Face it!

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:05.771 line:0%
-Face it.
-♪ Face It Challenge ♪

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:06.773
-Here's how it works.

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:08.841
Each round, we will draw a card,

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:11.678
which will tell us what face
we both have to make.

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:14.080
We'll look in our mirrors,
make our faces,

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.116
and reveal them
on the count of 3.

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:17.850
We'll stare at each other
for 10 seconds

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.452
while trying to hold our faces.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:21.121
The first person
to crack a smile,

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:23.022
laugh, or break the face --

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:24.524
-You can't even get through that
without breaking.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.959
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:30.597
I mean, we're playing a game
where you can't break?

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:33.599
-I've never --
This is such a loaded game.

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:35.468
Let's see
what our first face is.

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:37.036
All right.
Ready?

00:00:37.036 --> 00:00:38.304
Mug shot.

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:40.273 line:0%
-Mug shot.

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:41.641 line:0%
