00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:47.881 line:0%
-Okay, ready?
-Yep. -1, 2 --

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:50.250 line:0%
-You going to count it out?
-Yep. 1, 2, 3.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.484 line:0%
